[[Image:The Gates of Ironforge.jpg|thumb|300px|The Gates of Ironforge]]
The '''Gates of Ironforge''' (or the '''Ironforge Main Gate''')<ref>Sign post in Ironforge</ref> lead from the lands of [[Dun Morogh]] into the city of [[Ironforge]] proper. They are a grand sight, and are visible from far across Dun Morogh. They can be reached by heading north up the great ramp in central Dun Morogh, or southwest from the [[Commons]].

